units real
atom_style full
read_restart initial.restart
pair_modify table 0
kspace_style ewald 1e-7
kspace_modify gewald 0.35704189246991586 kmax/ewald 20 20 20
atom_modify sort 0 0
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no
fix thermostat all nvt temp 300 300 100 tchain 1
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step pe ke etotal temp
thermo_modify format float %.17g
run 20 start 0 stop 40
write_restart split.restart
write_dump all custom split.dump id x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz modify sort id format float %.17g
